{"skill":{"slug":"weather","displayName":"Weather"},"version":{"version":"1.0.0","createdAt":1767545394459,"changelog":"","changelogSource":null,"license":null,"files":[{"path":"SKILL.md","size":1169,"sha256":"1ca0c8d768ad603ea8d5d47f56a9b435fe575f7f34e719eda85c82003d740e93","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"skill-card.md","size":1748,"sha256":"e6ac17b2725468b4e7fb0c683c877d81352b8adbf463512c8aa02fca2d88ef1c","contentType":"text/markdown"}],"security":{"status":"clean","hasWarnings":true,"checkedAt":1789013613952,"model":null,"hasScanResult":true,"sha256hash":"b6d96df2ad9b4670293987afad32cabcc4db5f30842e471615bf348e6b2b0aac","virustotalUrl":"https://www.virustotal.com/gui/file/b6d96df2ad9b4670293987afad32cabcc4db5f30842e471615bf348e6b2b0aac","scanners":{"vt":{"status":"clean","verdict":"benign","normalizedStatus":"clean","analysis":"Type: OpenClaw Skill\nName: weather\nVersion: 1.0.0\n\nThe skill bundle is benign. It uses `curl` to fetch weather data from legitimate public APIs (`wttr.in` and `api.open-meteo.com`), as described in `SKILL.md`. The only file operation is writing a temporary image to `/tmp/weather.png`, which is a safe and expected behavior for displaying weather. There is no evidence of data exfiltration, malicious execution, persistence mechanisms, prompt injection attempts against the agent, or obfuscation.","source":"palm","checkedAt":1779159629745},"skillspector":{"status":"clean","normalizedStatus":"clean","score":0,"severity":"LOW","recommendation":"SAFE","issueCount":0,"checkedAt":1789013613952},"llm":{"status":"clean","verdict":"benign","normalizedStatus":"clean","confidence":"high","summary":"This skill is a straightforward weather lookup helper that uses public weather services with no hidden persistence or sensitive access.","dimensions":[{"detail":"Network access via curl is expected for a weather lookup skill, and queried services may receive the requested location or coordinates.","label":"Credentials","name":"environment_proportionality","rating":"note"},{"detail":"The package contains a single Markdown skill file with metadata requiring curl; no executable scripts, installers, dependencies, or setup hooks are present.","label":"Install Mechanism","name":"install_mechanism","rating":"ok"},{"detail":"Instructions are narrow, user-directed command examples for fetching weather data; there are no session overrides, hidden directives, or unrelated agent behavior.","label":"Instruction Scope","name":"instruction_scope","rating":"ok"},{"detail":"No persistence, privilege escalation, credential handling, background execution, or broad local file access is requested; the only file write shown is an optional PNG saved to /tmp.","label":"Persistence & Privilege","name":"persistence_privilege","rating":"ok"},{"detail":"The stated purpose is current weather and forecasts, and the artifact only provides curl examples for wttr.in and Open-Meteo weather queries.","label":"Purpose & Capability","name":"purpose_capability","rating":"ok"}],"guidance":"Install only if you are comfortable sending requested locations or coordinates to public weather services such as wttr.in or Open-Meteo. The reviewed artifact does not request credentials or make persistent system changes.","findings":null,"agenticRiskFindings":null,"riskSummary":null,"model":null,"checkedAt":1789013613952}}}}}